{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25152","headline":"湘弦曲 · 庄南杰","name":"湘弦曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楚云铮铮戛秋露，巫云峡雨飞朝暮。\n古磬高敲百尺楼，孤猨夜哭千丈树。\n云轩碾火声珑珑，连山卷尽长江空。\n莺啼寂寞花枝雨，鬼啸荒郊松柏风。\n满堂怨咽悲相续，苦调中含古离曲。\n繁弦响绝楚魂遥，湘江水碧湘山绿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庄南杰","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25152.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25152","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}